{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01EpaH6rTw7fYeH1mtadpcAe", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pakistan_People%27s_Party\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pakistan_Peoples_Party_(Shaheed_Bhutto)\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_political_parties_in_Pakistan\"}, {\"url\": \"https://nli.org.il/en/authorities/987007414307605171\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.dawn.com/news/1404648\"}, {\"url\": \"https://graphsearch.epfl.ch/concept/408998\"}, {\"url\": \"https://carnegieendowment.org/research/2022/03/the-peculiar-case-of-the-pakistan-peoples-party-as-an-opposition-party?lang=en\"}, {\"url\": \"https://historica.fandom.com/wiki/Pakistan_Peoples_Party\"}, {\"url\": \"https://carnegieendowment.org/research/2022/03/the-peculiar-case-of-the-pakistan-peoples-party-as-an-opposition-party\"}, {\"url\": \"https://simple.wikipedia.com/wiki/Pakistan_Peoples_Party\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:41:09.245Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "\"Pakistan Peoples Party\" \"largest opposition party\" \"four times\" OR \"three times\" wikipedia", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01Ro1NtBFeMGBYzkyZQ6gnU1", "content": [{"title": "Pakistan People%27s Party", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pakistan_People%27s_Party"}, {"title": "Pakistan Peoples Party (Shaheed Bhutto)", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pakistan_Peoples_Party_(Shaheed_Bhutto)"}, {"title": "List of political parties in Pakistan", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_political_parties_in_Pakistan"}, {"title": "Pakistan People's Party", "url": "https://nli.org.il/en/authorities/987007414307605171"}, {"title": "Pakistan Peoples Party", "url": "https://www.dawn.com/news/1404648"}, {"title": "graphsearch.epfl.ch", "url": "https://graphsearch.epfl.ch/concept/408998"}, {"title": "• Research", "url": "https://carnegieendowment.org/research/2022/03/the-peculiar-case-of-the-pakistan-peoples-party-as-an-opposition-party?lang=en"}, {"title": "Historica Wiki", "url": "https://historica.fandom.com/wiki/Pakistan_Peoples_Party"}, {"title": "• Research", "url": "https://carnegieendowment.org/research/2022/03/the-peculiar-case-of-the-pakistan-peoples-party-as-an-opposition-party"}, {"title": "Pakistan People's Party", "url": "https://simple.wikipedia.com/wiki/Pakistan_Peoples_Party"}]}, "The search turned up the answer: the PPP has been the largest opposition party four times, and Wikipedia's main article lists those years. The main article says the party has led the executive four times (1977, 1988, 1993, 2008) and emerged as the largest opposition party on four occasions (1990, 1997, 2002, 2013) (Pakistan People's Party article). Other sources give the same four opposition years, including a Wikipedia-derived library record, and an EPFL concept page.\n\nTwo details differ across sources. The main article lists four government terms, while some sources list five wins, counting 1970. The 1970 win is the one source that supports five, and it does not affect the opposition count.\n\nThe party's current standing also appears in these results. The main Wikipedia article says the party now holds the most Senate seats and the second-most in the National Assembly. The library record and the EPFL page say the same, but they are older Wikipedia-derived descriptions."], "durationSeconds": 5.847960000000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01EpaH6rTw7fYeH1mtadpcAe", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
