{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDWJ2N6b1aKMsuZ5cPKU", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：4 次。**\n\n英文维基百科的“Pakistan People's Party”条目说，人民党在全国层面四次成为最大反对党，分别是 **1990、1997、2002 和 2013 年**。EPFL Graph Search 的概念页内容取自维基百科，给出的也是这四个年份。\n\n需要注意，2018–2022 年人民党也在反对党阵营，但当时最大的反对党是穆斯林联盟（谢里夫派），人民党排第二，所以这次不算在内。我没有直接查证这一点，它来自我自己的了解。我共搜索了 2 次。\n\n依据网址：\n- [Pakistan People's Party – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pakistan_People%27s_Party)\n- [EPFL Graph Search – Pakistan People's Party](https://graphsearch.epfl.ch/concept/408998)\n- [Dawn – Pakistan Peoples Party](https://www.dawn.com/news/1404648)（印证 2013 年人民党是国民议会最大反对党）"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1051, "cache_read_input_tokens": 5495, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1051}, "output_tokens": 6, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:41:15.343Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDWJ23VYmKCRvZFkCMVZ"}
